  "notes": "The table tools update!\nFixed: dragging cards to the GY no longer lags while the dust puff plays.\nNew: changed ATK/DEF shows green when raised and red when lowered, and you can change a monster's Level or Rank too.\nNew: right-click a monster's ATK/DEF for quick changes (+500, double, halve...), or make a change last until end of turn.\nNew: notes on cards, reminders that pop up at a later phase, equip lines, and pinned cards to read beside the field.\nNew: rest on the GY or Banished to see its top cards; a countdown on Resolve while a chain waits.\nNew: Save recap on the result screen makes a picture of the duel to share.\nNew: right-click COIN or DICE for the history of every flip and roll.\nNew: DMs can save whole encounters (character, deck, board and LP) and start them in one click.\nNew: Ctrl+K to jump to any screen, deck, character or card.\nNew: a level curve and a missing-cards total in the Deck Builder, a streak flame on Home, and gold MASTERED pack tiles in the Shop.\nNew: click a card's picture on its page to flip it over to your sleeve; pop-ups now stack instead of overlapping.",
